%% title: Failure: the deploy response is lost and the job retries
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as deploy job
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant DB as event log
    CI->>S: deploy (Project, fragment digest)
    S->>DB: rollout created
    S-->>CI: response lost (timeout)
    CI->>S: retry: same Project and digest
    S->>DB: find the existing rollout
    S-->>CI: same rollout id, no second run
